{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2020-10", "window": 2, "start_date": 1602115200, "end_date": 1602806399, "month_true_total": 1960, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:01:02 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "77620383", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084225486", "personaname": "Yuki Ryu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/J0KerD97/", "num_games_owned": 201, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 137201, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 86623, "last_played": 1787162488, "avatar": "c1b19f109f77ba9c4981c40f81f661486e35b7da"}, "language": "english", "review": "Decent game. Meh", "timestamp_created": 1602801750, "timestamp_updated": 1602801750, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "77617354", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058078274", "personaname": "MementoMori", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/smaulden/", "num_games_owned": 1636, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 115079, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 115042, "last_played": 1602802980, "avatar": "cd7289a3056010a89ba2e6d08230bce2334324a3"}, "language": "english", "review": "I played for ~2000 hours. But I haven't played regularly in at least a year. The devs have lost their way, and despite admitting that the last 3 or 4 expansions (back to at least Railjack) were lackluster best, have made no real headway. They are more interested in signaling how good their morals are than actually making a game that is enjoyable to play. Why bother about bugs and a sustainable gameplay loop when you can tell everyone how restrictive your game chat is? Or how any criticism of the dev team is met with utter disdain and immediately playing the victim card? \n\nI left a year ago, despite dumping well over a thousand dollars into the game. I check back once every few months to see how it's going. Not good. They can't seem to understand that no one cares about your politics if you can't make a game that has fewer bugs and is enjoyable to play. I shouldn't consider your game a damn second job. Your community shouldn't consider the first month of every PC release the bug-testing window. Your community shouldn't consider the first month of every PC release the No-Man's-Land of grinding until you finally figure out how to make it not painful. Your community shouldn't lament finding a fun way to play the game because you'll probably nerf it next patch. \n\nLet us play the game how we want to play. Trust us to be the adults that you market your adult game about mass-murdering space ninjas too. Until they do, I can't recommend this game.", "timestamp_created": 1602796672, "timestamp_updated": 1602796672, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 34, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.643329858779907227", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 11, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 10, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "77617217", "author": {"steamid": "76561198139431564", "personaname": "TalkB0X", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198139431564/", "num_games_owned": 185, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 78518, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 63829, "last_played": 1786848105, "avatar": "360236e555049f204b12d3a8685a3b9b9764ebfe"}, "language": "english", "review": "yeah its pretty cool.", "timestamp_created": 160279